{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "main_14_level_main_14-18_beg",
  "groupId": "main_14",
  "stageId": "main_14-18",
  "title": "列王行迹",
  "storyCode": "14-20",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_14-18_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "6a23f77f9d86e621aa56b2622637add7c19c0c068468e00a2ab430016ddc371b",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "宇宙......什么宇宙？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "text": "你们所熟知的语言中并不包括这个词语。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "text": "它是远比天空与大地还要广阔的概念，是所有的时间与空间，以及被它包含的一切。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "text": "即便是最为傲慢的“神明”都不该宣称自己能够掌握宇宙的全部。因为这个词语本身就象征着无穷的边界，以及时刻变化的可能性。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "text": "但是，源石会将这一切悉数纳入，在其内部形成一个“内化宇宙”——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "停。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "总之，两件事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "一、不知道什么原因，我们跟着飞空艇一头扎进了源石里面——天知道为什么小小的石头里面居然会有这么宽敞的地方。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "二、我们还没死，不知道以什么方式还活在源石内部的，“宇宙”里？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "text": "......可以这么理解。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "嗯？什么反应都没有，连个泡都没冒吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "W小姐！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "刚刚你扔出去的......呃，是炸弹？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "不然呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "我总得摸索一下。你就当炸弹是我的手好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "老女人说我们被关在源石里了，说不定我碰到边界，顺便炸出个——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "小心！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "——刚刚怎么回事？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "就好像......有什么东西拽了我一把。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "底下那黄色的东西是液态源石吗？炸弹炸到什么玩意了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "text": "炸弹并未引爆，因为缺乏能量反应条件。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "text": "在这片源石海中，我完全感知不到源石。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "text": "......或许可以理解，毕竟外部的源石皆是以与其他物质结合的形式存在，亦必须符合外部“宇宙”的规则。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "text": "而此处的源石，即是规则本身。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "你这话还不如老女人说的好懂。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "text": "我们已进入另一套语法之中。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "text": "我能察觉到这片源石海洋中包含的......语言。浩瀚，磅礴，无边无际。我目前尚不能彻底解析。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "text": "停下来，Logos。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "text": "至少在此时此地，别再尝试去理解这“语言”。我们不能过多......扰动。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "text": "虽然我们很可能已在危险的注视之下，但这艘船被允许存在，就证明我们暂时是安全的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "罗德岛？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "船和源石海......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "这艘罗德岛......是因你而存在，Dr.{@nickname}。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "我们本应被源石同化，成为这片海洋的一部分。是你救了我们。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "你修改......不，重新制定了部分规则。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "在你自己都没有察觉的情况下，你使用了那种“语言”。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "刚刚我说的那种吗？可我记不得了。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "它好像在我脑子里，又好像不在。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "哈？这个家伙还有这种能耐？你不会想告诉我，船上那些莫名其妙的场景，也都是这家伙的一场梦吧？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "那“温暖人心”的幻想可真是......恶心。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我也并不喜欢。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "......呵。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "W转过头去，略带思索地看向前方。\n在进入内化宇宙后，她的视线就很少落在你身上。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "问题的关键来了，我们撞进了这片源石里面，还有没有办法出去？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "这艘装满了幽灵的船，准备带我们去什么地方？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "罗德岛航行在金色的海洋上。水面看起来毫无涟漪，更像是一面纯金色的镜子。\n一个疑问突然击中了你——你们真的是在航行吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "海面好像是静止的......所有东西都是。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "太安静了，我什么都感觉不到。流动的情感，充实的记忆......全部消失了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "凯尔希医生，这里是源石内部，不是吗？源石明明吞吃了那么多东西......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "毁于天灾的城市，死于矿石病的人......所有生命存在过的痕迹，它们不该都在这片海洋里吗？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "为什么......这里什么都没有？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "因为这里是......尽头。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "万物尽数被源石封存，无法改变，也不会毁灭的尽头。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "真棒啊，一个连死都不会死的“好”去处，拉特兰都没这么神圣。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "难怪船上没有萨卡兹。这么温馨甜蜜的好地方，怎么可能——容得下我们这种妖魔鬼怪？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "......没有萨卡兹？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "好像确实是这样......从刚才开始，除了W小姐和Logos先生，的确没有见到任何一个萨卡兹。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "萨卡兹......与源石紧密相连的萨卡兹，都去了哪里？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "船撞上了什么......？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "海面上有东西？！",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "text": "“看见”。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "“萨卡兹”",
          "text": "——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "——！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "这些影子，是萨卡兹！他们正在——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "text": "——行军。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "text": "战争始终在继续，无论在外面的战场上，还是在这里......亦无论是活着，还是死去。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "水面上出现无数萨卡兹的影子。\n温迪戈，炎魔，食腐者，女妖......以及许多被时间磨灭的古老氏族。\n他们有的拿着棍棒长枪，有的拿着弓弩长剑，有的背靠巫术火炮。\n水面是静止的，而这些身影构成洪流，向前奔涌而去。\n冲锋。厮杀。\n永不止歇。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "text": "战争。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "text": "萨卡兹与万物之间的战争，持续万年，从未结束。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "text": "原来，这即是，萨卡兹的众魂归处。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
          "text": "罗德岛本舰就在前面了，坚持住！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "夜莺",
          "text": "（沉重的喘息）",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "闪灵",
          "text": "我——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
          "text": "闪灵？你怎么了！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "闪灵",
          "text": "......那扇门已经打开。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "闪灵",
          "text": "死与生的距离，前所未有地近。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "闪灵",
          "text": "所有的萨卡兹，都能听见。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫德雷",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "扛住这一轮冲击！飞空艇被源石吞噬，王庭术师暂时管不到这里！这是我们唯一的机会，脊椎的损伤太大了——\n赫德雷？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫德雷",
          "text": "我听见了......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊内丝",
          "text": "巨兽又对你说话了？说什么了？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫德雷",
          "text": "不......是另外的声音......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫德雷",
          "text": "......我听见，历史中所有的战争，都在同时进行。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "因陀罗",
          "text": "维娜，你看！伦蒂尼姆上面——那坨红色的玩意儿是不是又变大了？！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "推进之王",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "摩根",
          "text": "不仅变大了，而且红得发黑。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "摩根",
          "text": "就跟......整个天空都在变成源石一样......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "推进之王",
          "text": "......风暴并没有真正止歇。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "推进之王",
          "text": "诸王之息覆盖不了更大的范围......萨卡兹会毁掉整座城市，甚至远远不止。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "推进之王",
          "text": "阿米娅......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "推进之王",
          "text": "......你们一定要赶上。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "众魂......拦住了我们。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "在这个一切事物都因源石静止的地方，只有众魂，还在抗争......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "所有人都听到了，回荡在金色海面上低沉的怒吼。\n萨卡兹的战争不会停止，萨卡兹的愤怒没有尽头。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "有意思，萨卡兹死掉的老英雄们就在眼前鞠躬尽瘁，“不得好死”说的就是这种情况吧。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "可是他们为什么要拦在我们前面......？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "我们前面这树根一样的东西，它看起来是不是很像一座塔？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "从踏上甲板的那刻起，你就注意到了它。\n它矗立在你们视野的最中央，与金色的水面和寂静的天空既融为一体，又格格不入。\n那真的是一座塔吗？\n假如它真的是一座塔的话，它一定高得超乎想象。\n为什么在源石的海洋里，万物静滞的尽头，会有一座塔？\n答案呼之欲出。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "......巴别塔。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "从一开始，飞空艇的目的地就是这里......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "她就在那座塔上，她在带领着萨卡兹众魂！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "是的，她在等我们。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "那座塔......是这片没有方向的海洋里，唯一的信标。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "所有的答案，都在我们的起点。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "我们会登上巴别塔......走向她。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "然后......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "阿米娅。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "嗯？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "我清醒得很。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "都走到这里了......我不可能搞不清楚自己想要什么。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "那么多活人还在外头拼命呢，再不快点的话，我们马上就该在这里见到更多眼熟的英雄坯子了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "老女人，让你的小怪物也出来干点活！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "过去的路不会很好走。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "我......做不到。Mon3tr无法出现在这里，我也不希望引起一些不必要的注意。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "——？！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "啧，又是些你不能说的理由吗？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "Dr.{@nickname}，这里对我有很多限制，但对你，不会有任何的影响。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "我需要你让这艘舰船动起来。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我并没有真正掌过舵。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "这里是甲板不是舰桥......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "你并不需要。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "这艘罗德岛将驶向何方，并不依赖于你的驾驶技巧，或者任何机械和能源装置。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "这里是源石的内部。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "你早已发现，源石于你而言，有着特殊的意义。而你对于源石，同样无可取代。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我以为我不该知道这些。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我以为你不会对我说这些。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "我的沉默有许多原因。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "坦诚地说，我对你是否应该找回这些知识，也仍有疑虑。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "因为我曾经做过的事......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我现在理解了。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "你说过，你恨我。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "恨，痛苦，愤怒，我全都无法否认。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "在那一个时刻，我失去的并不只有特蕾西娅。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "还有......另一个我曾希望能够信任的人。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......是我。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "你感到失望。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "我很失望......对我自己。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "我并未完全察觉到你的“改变”。或者说，我所做的准备不足以扭转当时的结果。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "我们曾窥见过实现理想的曙光，而特蕾西娅仓促的离去熄灭了炬火。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "我们已再度步入最深的黑夜里，如果不能做出最正确的选择，这一刻的黑暗将成为永恒。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "或许你的确不该再信任我。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "......不。我理应信任你。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "我的确担心让你重拾与源石相关的回忆......会再度带来不可预料的改变。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "但你已一次又一次地向我，向阿米娅，向所有人证明......我担心的事并不会成真。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "我唯一能确定的是，我们是同行者。从切尔诺伯格到伦蒂尼姆，你的经历，你的情感，塑造了如今的你。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "就像此时此刻——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "你保护了我们，令我们不至于立刻被源石吞噬，变成庞杂的信息流的一部分。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "你让罗德岛出现，让我们能在静滞中保有继续前行的机会。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "Dr.{@nickname}，为你自己指明出路吧。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "我们的未来是何走向，罗德岛会驶向何方——将由你的意志决定。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "好。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我一直知道。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "罗德岛——",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "前进。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "你清晰地感觉到脚下的船在前行。\n穿过源石的海洋。穿过众魂的军阵。\n塔越来越近。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "这海怎么突然发起疯来？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "众魂正在影响周遭环境。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "内化宇宙......不再稳定。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "罗德岛很难再往前了。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "这些已故的萨卡兹正阻碍我们。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "众魂很愤怒。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "他们——全都看向了这里。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "行，爱看就看吧。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "看着我，怎么踩在他们头顶——跨过去！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "巨浪像手掌一样拍向小小的罗德岛。\nW咧嘴笑了。\n她迎着浪潮纵身一跃。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "——W小姐！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "W的身影瞬间消失在惊涛骇浪之中。\n但下一刻，她的笑声就从金色的雾中传了出来。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "哈哈，我就知道——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "这玩意儿不属于源石海，一定能炸开！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "真没想到——我会想要拆开——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "巴别塔！！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "崩裂声，从轻到响。\n通天的巨塔不可能被几颗小小的炸弹撼动。但巨塔剥离了一缕根须，向渺小的人们垂了下来，形成了一条从甲板通往塔底的路。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "这里，快！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "你们飞快地攀上垂落的塔底结构。\n出乎意料，那白色物体触感柔韧，仿佛......某种织物。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "阿米娅——",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "上来！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我会抓住你。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "阿米娅轻轻地触碰那“根须”。\n刹那之间，无数双手自海里，自塔上，自虚空伸向她。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "众魂......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "源石的海洋近乎沸腾。\n众魂渴盼魔王。众魂想把魔王留下。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "text": "——阿米娅，往前走。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "text": "去见特蕾西娅殿下。得到答案，跨越答案。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "Logos先生......？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "text": "我对殿下，亦有思念。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "text": "但我们早已在多年前完成告别。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "text": "当时巴别塔尚未隐没于大地，最初的同僚们下定决心，将以生命践行理想。殿下与我，皆不例外。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "text": "而众魂的声音......我会回应。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "text": "自我第一次唱响挽歌，我便在等待此刻。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "众魂的意志自怒涛之下崛起。\n他们有的手持宝剑，有的役使巨兽，有的统帅千军。\n他们头戴相同的冠冕——\n他们是萨卡兹的君主。\n他们是萨卡兹的存续。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "“无名的魔王”",
          "text": "未有我们未曾踏过的路，未有我们未曾受过的苦。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "“无名的魔王”",
          "text": "你不可能比我们更强大。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "“无名的魔王”",
          "text": "你不可能比我们更无畏。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "他们审视，他们诘问。\n无数来自过往的情感凝结为实质的波涛，足以卷走任何个体的意志。\n可千万遍冲刷之后，他们面前的人依旧站立在原地。\n年轻的萨卡兹举起骨笔，指向所有无名的魔王。\n无需言语。\n他的咒言即是他的答复。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
